 R←Test_29(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;qdmx
⍝ `trapInternalErrors`: with 1 an internal problem is swallowed, with 0 it surfaces.
⍝ The internal problem is a log function that cannot be found.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.errorFolder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 parms.(killThreads saveErrorWS createHTML saveCrash saveVars)←0
 parms.logFunction←'NoSuchFunction'               ⍝ No dot and no parent: cannot be found
 parms.signal←501
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder

 parms.trapInternalErrors←1
 :Trap 501
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1                              ⍝ `signal` must be signalled in any case
 :EndTrap

 parms.trapInternalErrors←0
 :Trap 0
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp 6≠qdmx.EN                      ⍝ The internal problem, not `signal`
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir parms.errorFolder
